mission "A Name Scratched in Brass"
    name "A Name Scratched in Brass"
    description "Deliver the recovered token to an archivist who recognises the expedition's private seal."
    source "Gallows Key"
    destination "Nueva Esperanza"
    reward 1135
    speaker offer "Archivist Celia Rojas"
    speaker visit "Archivist Celia Rojas"
    speaker complete "Archivist Celia Rojas"
    to offer
        has "The Last Pilot of the Crown: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `Archivist Celia Rojas has placed the brass token beneath a magnifying lens. The private seal scratched into its rim is faint, but she recognises the pattern.`
            `Celia adjusts the lens. "This mark belongs to the lost expedition. It was not used on public manifests; it was a private sign for sealed correspondence. Whoever carried it was not meant to be questioned at a customs desk."`
            choice
                `"I will hear the whole story, then take the work."`
                    accept
                `"What have the records left out?"`
                    goto details
                `"There are limits to what I will take on. This is one."`
                    close
            label details
                `She opens a register and leaves a space beside one entry. "Let me compare the token with the surviving records. If the seal matches, we may find who issued the order and where the ships were sent."`
                choice
                    `"You can rely on me. I will start at once."`
                        accept
                    `"No. Do not wait for me."`
                        close
    on accept
        log "Accepted A Name Scratched in Brass. Deliver the recovered token to an archivist who recognises the expedition's private seal."
    on visit
        conversation
            `At Nueva Esperanza, Celia matches the token's seal to a private entry in the register. "The expedition's name was removed from the public copy," she says. "But someone forgot to remove the mark from the margin."`
    on complete
        conversation
            `Celia closes the register and locks it away. "There is a name here, though not yet a face. That is enough to keep the inquiry alive. I will preserve the record where no single crown can quietly claim it."`
        log "Completed A Name Scratched in Brass. Received 1135 gold. Deliver the recovered token to an archivist who recognises the expedition's private seal."
